{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quels sont les 8 personnages jouables dans le jeu original [i]Super Mario Kart[/i]?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0","s":"It's-a him! You know, the one whose name is in the title of the game?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"It's-a him, the main character's brother! A sensitive plumber just trying to get by."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2","s":"Please don't forget about this little mushroom who wears a vest."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3","s":"Wasn't there a royal racer? Someone who was a queen, or a prince, or a..."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"Don't forget about this upright turtle who wears shoes! You forgot about him, didn't you?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"This guy loves bananas and hates barrels. He's like the opposite of me!"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"What about the big spiky monster guy? Remember him?"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"He's a dinosaur who can lay eggs on command! I know you know who this is."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
